# Normalize line endings in the repository, check out native per platform.
# Keeps future diffs free of whole-file CRLF churn on mixed Windows/Linux teams.
* text=auto

# --- Binaries: never touch their bytes -------------------------------------
# `text=auto` decides by sniffing the first 8000 bytes for NULs, so a model
# whose JSON chunk fits inside that window can be mistaken for text. Any
# conversion would change the file size, and tools/fetch_models.py refuses a
# model whose size does not match its pinned expectation byte-for-byte -- so a
# mangled checkout becomes a silent re-download or a broken WebGL viewer.
# Pin the media types instead of trusting the heuristic (HANDOFF §5.3).
*.glb   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
